    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to introduce this very attractive, 3-bedroom family home with attic converted and extended sun room to rear. Immaculately presented and perfectly located in a quiet cul de sac, adjacent green area. This beautiful property has been very well maintained and enhanced by its current owners & is sure to interest buyers seeking a beautiful home is a sought-after popular neighbourhood. Accommodation consists of 123 sq./m with smart entrance hallway, living room, stylish fully fitted kitchen/dining room, extended sunroom and downstairs wc. Upstairs there are three bedrooms, one with ensuite, attic conversion and family bathroom. This fantastic property benefits a private landscaped rear garden with purpose built block shed/workshop. There is gas fired radiator central heating, and the windows are upvc double glazed. Berwick Way is situated 2km from Swords Town Centre, with its selection of cafes, bars & restaurants plus a host of shops in the Pavilions S.C. There is an abundance of sports facilities close by including, Fingallians GAA, Swords Manor Celtic, GYM Plus, Alsaa, Sportslink and Swords Lawn Tennis Club. Excellent local public transport links to Dublin City Centre are provided for and the M50/M1 junction is within a short drive. Viewing is very highly recommended to appreciate the many fine qualities of this wonderful home, garden, setting and location."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nHallway - 5m x 1.89m\nEntrance hallway with wall cladding and Porcelain floor tiling\n\nReception Room - 5.2m x 3.64m\nLarge living room with solid wood floors, wonderful feature fireplace, built in storage units and recessed lighting\n\nKitchen/dining room - 5.64m x 2.95m\nFully fitted kitchen/dining room with wall and floor tiling - access to sun room\n\nSunroom - 3.93m x 2.77m\nExtended to rear with solid wood floors and velux windows in apex roof - access to rear garden\n\nDownstairs wc - 1m x 1.2m\nWc and whb with floor and wall tiling\n\nStairs and landing - 2.37m x 2.07m\nWith wall cladding, fitted carpets and access to attic conversion\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.58m x 3.5m\nMain double bedroom with fitted carpets, quality built in wardrobes and access to ensuite\n\nEnsuite Bathroom - 1.5m x 2.04m\nCubicle shower, wc and whb\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.81m x 3.15m\nDouble bedroom to the front with wood floors\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.39m x 2.22m\nFront bedroom with Parque floors\n\nAttic conversion - 4.78m x 4.26m\nAttic conversion with wood floors and built in wardrobes - suitable for a variety of uses\n\nBathroom - 1.78m x 2.04m\nMain family bathroom with new bath, wc and whb\n\nOutside front - \nFront cobble lock walled driveway\n\nOutside rear - \nProfessionally landscaped, low maintenance garden - walled, Granite paving - well stocked with Conifers, Lavender and Spanish daisies\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Stunning 3 bedroom semi with attic conversion</li><li> Extended sunroom</li><li> Large living room</li><li> Well equipped Kitchen/dining room</li><li> Downstairs wc</li><li> Ensuite to main bedroom</li><li> Gas fired radiator central heating</li><li> Pvc Double glazed windows</li><li> Cobble lock driveway</li><li> Landscaped rear garden</li><li> Superb condition</li><li> Cul de sac location</li><li> Walking distance to primary and secondary schools</li><li> Close to Swords Town Centre</li><li> Easy access to Dublin Airport, M50 and City Centre</ul>"
      },
